{number: 159}
{title: His Name Is Wonderful}
{key: Eb}

{start_of_verse: 1}
His [Eb] name is Wonderful,
His [Bb7] name is Wonderful,
His [Eb] name is [Ab] Wonderful,
[Eb] Jesus my [Bb7] Lord;
He is the [Eb] mighty King,
Master of [Bb7] everything,
His [Eb] name is [Ab] Wonderful,
[Eb] Jesus, [Bb7] my [Eb] Lord.
He's the [Bb7] great Shepherd, the [Eb] Rock of all ages,
Al-[F7] mighty God is [Bb7] He;
Bow [Eb] down before Him, love and a-[Bb7] dore Him,
His [Eb] name is [Ab] Wonderful, [Eb] Jesus [Bb7] my [Eb] Lord.
{end_of_verse}
